    "title": "Fatal ATV accident on Cedar Mountain - NewsBreak",
    "text": "sunews.net\nwebsite\nKane County, Utah\nFatal ATV accident on Cedar Mountain\n7 hours ago\nAt about 7:30 p.m., on Saturday July 5, Kane County Dispatch received a call about an ATV rollover accident on Cedar Mountain. A seven-year-old female was reported to be unconscious, and her family was transporting her to the Cedar Mountain Fire Station. When Kane County Deputies arrived, the Emergency Medical staff at the fire station were providing care. The female’s injuries were too extensive, and she passed away a short time later. She was transported to the Utah State Medical Examiner’s Office for further investigation.",
